import LieGroups.Manifold.RiemannianMetric
import LieGroups.Manifold.ParametricMFDeriv
import Mathlib.Analysis.InnerProductSpace.PiL2
import Mathlib.Tactic.Positivity
import Mathlib.Tactic.Ring

/-!
# Checks for smooth metric construction

Construct a nonconstant metric on the real line and an actual zero-dimensional metric.
The final check applies the derivative of a smooth family with fixed output base point.

Run `lake env lean scripts/CheckRiemannianMetric.lean` after `lake build`.

